-- the square of the coefficient: (2J+1) a! b! c! / (s+1)! · X! Y! x1! y1! x2! y2! · (Racah's sum)²
cg-square : Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → QP
cg-square a b c s tJ x1 y1 x2 y2 X Y = qp-mul (times (suc tJ) (times (fact a) (times (fact b) (fact c))) , fact (suc s)) (qp-mul (times (fact X) (times (fact Y) (times (fact x1) (times (fact y1) (times (fact x2) (fact y2))))) , suc zero) (qp-diff-sq (fst (racah-sum a b c y1 x2 a)) (snd (racah-sum a b c y1 x2 a))))
